{
  "formTitle": "DV-105(A) City and State Where Children Lived",
  "_comment": "DV-105(A) is attached to DV-105 when item 4a is answered No: the children have not all lived together for the last five years. It lists, for one child or a group of children who have always lived together, where they lived and with whom - item 2 for the first group, item 3 for the next - with the same columns DV-105 item 4 prints. Field paths are the PDF's; the columns are read from the rectangles (pipeline-field-labels.js), because item 3's first row numbers its boxes out of printed order. The four footer buttons are not questions. Box 1 ticks from DV-105's own No, by name.",
